  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The result of factorization must be a product of polynomial expressions. A and D are polynomial multiplication; the right-hand side of C still contains a plus sign and is not in product form.",
